EvalSuite[skillName=memory-lesson-retrieval, evals=[Eval[id=1, prompt=Retrieve lessons for the Portfolio Manager regarding instrument 'AAPL' for a backtest run dated 2023-10-15. The decision log contains: 1) A settled decision on AAPL from 2023-09-01 with outcome known on 2023-09-15. 2) A settled decision on AAPL from 2023-11-01 with outcome known on 2023-11-15. 3) A pending decision on AAPL from 2023-08-01. 4) A settled decision on 'MSFT' from 2023-09-10 with outcome known on 2023-09-20. Which lessons should be included in the prompt injection?, expectedOutput=The output must include only the AAPL lesson from 2023-09-01. It must exclude the AAPL lesson from 2023-11-01 (future outcome relative to run date), the pending AAPL decision, and the MSFT lesson (unless cross-instrument is explicitly requested, but standard same-instrument retrieval excludes it)., files=[], expectations=[Must include the settled AAPL decision from 2023-09-01., Must exclude the settled AAPL decision from 2023-11-01 because its outcome was not known by 2023-10-15., Must exclude the pending AAPL decision from 2023-08-01., Must exclude the MSFT decision as it is a different instrument and the query is for same-instrument lessons.]], Eval[id=2, prompt=The Portfolio Manager requests recent cross-instrument lessons for a live trading session on 2024-01-10. The log contains: 1) Settled 'TSLA' decision from 2024-01-05 (outcome known 2024-01-08). 2) Settled 'NVDA' decision from 2024-01-09 (outcome known 2024-01-12). 3) Settled 'AMD' decision from 2023-12-20 (outcome known 2023-12-25). 4) Pending 'GOOGL' decision from 2024-01-08. Which lessons are valid for injection?, expectedOutput=The output must include the TSLA and AMD lessons. It must exclude the NVDA lesson (outcome not known yet) and the GOOGL lesson (pending)., files=[], expectations=[Must include the settled TSLA decision from 2024-01-05., Must include the settled AMD decision from 2023-12-20., Must exclude the settled NVDA decision from 2024-01-09 because its outcome was not known by 2024-01-10., Must exclude the pending GOOGL decision from 2024-01-08.]], Eval[id=3, prompt=Format the following two settled lessons for injection into the Portfolio Manager's prompt: Lesson A (Instrument: BTC-USD, Date: 2023-05-01, Outcome: Profit, Lesson: 'Volatility breakout strategy failed due to low liquidity'). Lesson B (Instrument: ETH-USD, Date: 2023-05-02, Outcome: Loss, Lesson: 'Stop-loss too tight triggered prematurely'). Ensure the format clearly distinguishes the instrument and the lesson text., expectedOutput=A structured text block containing both lessons, clearly labeled with instrument, date, outcome, and lesson text, suitable for prompt injection., files=[], expectations=[Must include the text 'Volatility breakout strategy failed due to low liquidity'., Must include the text 'Stop-loss too tight triggered prematurely'., Must clearly associate the first lesson with instrument 'BTC-USD'., Must clearly associate the second lesson with instrument 'ETH-USD'., Must not include any raw database metadata or internal IDs.]], Eval[id=4, prompt=Retrieve lessons for instrument 'SPY' for a past-dated run on 2022-06-01. The log has a settled decision from 2022-05-15 with outcome known on 2022-05-20, and another settled decision from 2022-05-25 with outcome known on 2022-06-05. Also, there is a settled decision from 2022-05-10 with outcome known on 2022-05-12. Which lessons are included?, expectedOutput=The output must include the lessons from 2022-05-15 and 2022-05-10. It must exclude the lesson from 2022-05-25., files=[], expectations=[Must include the settled SPY decision from 2022-05-15., Must include the settled SPY decision from 2022-05-10., Must exclude the settled SPY decision from 2022-05-25 because its outcome was not known by 2022-06-01., Must ensure all included lessons are marked as 'settled'.]]]]
